PUBLICATION CHECKLIST
=====================

[x] Original questionnaire CSV excluded.
[x] IP addresses, user agents, timestamps, and location data excluded.
[x] Private message bodies excluded.
[x] Private recipient names replaced with generic labels.
[x] Teacher-only message collection excluded.
[x] Fourteen public messages retained according to their sharing choices.
[x] Public signatures retained only where public attribution was permitted.

Before every public release:

  1. Run make test.
  2. Search the full repository for private names and questionnaire metadata.
  3. Run npm audit.
  4. Build with the pinned Emscripten version.
  5. Complete both web walkthrough routes.

The public website performs no analytics, authentication, uploads, cookies, or
network submission of commands. All play occurs inside the browser.
